hadiths[8]{hadithnumber,text}:
"139501","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Said ibn al- Musayyab and from Abu Salama ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Awf that the Messenger of Allah"
"139502","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Said ibn al- Musayyab and from Abu Salama ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Awf that the Messenger of Allah"
"139601","Yahya related to me from Malik from Kathir ibn Farqad that he asked Abu Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm about a man who sells food to a man for gold on credit, then buys dates with the gold before he takes possession of the gold. He disliked that and forbade it. And Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab the like of that. Malik said: Sa'id ibn al-Musayyab, Sulayman ibn Yasar, Abu Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm, and Ibn Shihab only forbade that a man should sell wheat for gold then the man buys dates with the gold before he takes possession of the gold from the sale in which he bought the wheat from him. But as for buying with the gold for which he sold the wheat on credit dates from other than the seller from whom he bought the wheat, before he takes possession of the gold, and the one from whom he bought the dates refers the debt to his debtor who bought the wheat from him for the gold which is due to him in the price of the dates, there is no harm in that. Malik said: I have asked about that more than one of the people of knowledge and they did not see any harm in it."
"139602","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Sa'id that he heard Sa'id ibn al-Musayyab say: ""When you come to a land where they give full measure and weight, prolong your stay there. And when you come to a land where they give short measure and weight, shorten your stay there."""""""
"139701","Malik related to me that he heard the like of that from Sulayman ibn Yasar. Malik spoke about a man who bought out one of the partners in a shared property"
"139702","Malik related to me that he heard the like of that from Sulayman ibn Yasar. Malik spoke about a man who bought out one of the partners in a shared property"
"139801","Yahya said that Malik related from Muhammad ibn Umara from Abu Bakr ibn Hazm that Uthman ibn Affan said"
"139802","Yahya said that Malik related from Muhammad ibn Umara from Abu Bakr ibn Hazm that Uthman ibn Affan said"
